SUMMARY:Verity
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 9:20am\, 11:50am\, 2:25pm\, 5pm\, 7:30pm\, 10pm\nAdapted
  from Colleen Hoover's best-selling novel\, this seductive\, psychological
  thriller follows renowned author Verity Crawford (Anne Hathaway) and Lowe
 n Ashleigh (Dakota Johnson)\, a struggling writer who relocates to the rem
 ote Crawford estate to ghostwrite for Verity. After Lowen uncovers what ap
 pears to be Verity's chilling autobiographical notes\, she wrestles with t
 he disturbing and twisted confessions about Verity’s husband Jeremy (Jos
 h Hartnett)\, and finds it hard to separate fiction from reality\, manipul
 ation from attraction\, and opportunity from obsession.\nhttps://www.phoen
 ixmovies.net/movies/verity/HO00001763\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://
 pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/verity/HO00001763
END:VEVENT
