SUMMARY:Found Footage Festival Vol. 11
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Join us\, brothers and sisters\, for a 90-minute VHS revival ho
 sted by the Found Footage Trio: Joe Pickett (The Onion) and Nick Prueher (
 Late Show). Like the lord himself\, these holy messengers emerge from thei
 r video-strewn cave in Brooklyn to resurrect their latest and greatest fin
 ds in a joyous analog celebration. You’ll see not one but two bigfoot vi
 deos. Can I get an amen? You’ll see cowboy butts in tight Wranglers. Tes
 tify! You’ll see a crafting guru paint a fish’s eyeball to make a pret
 ty towel. Hallelujah\, these VHS tapes are born again!\nhttps://www.thetri
 plex.org/movie/found-footage-festival-vol-11\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: h
 ttps://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/found-footage-festival-vol-11
